inflation-breaks-target-ceiling-before-runoff","title":"Brazil Inflation Breaches Ceiling","date":"2026-10-23","url":"https://zuhd.news/a/2026-10-23-brazil-inflation-breaks-target-ceiling-before-runoff"}]}},"mkt:idx":{"eventId":"mkt:idx:2026-10-26:-1","kind":"monthly","changePct":-12.993111672601854,"newsHash":"1a256ab0058b280a","startDate":"2026-09-30","endDate":"2026-10-28","revision":15,"validated":{"text":"Stocks on the Indonesia Stock Exchange lost 13.0% over 20 sessions. The slide included a 10% plunge to a six-year low and, days later, an 11.6% fall in a single Friday session, Jakarta's worst day since 1998. Both drops came as MSCI moved against Indonesia's market status.","citations":[{"slug":"2026-10-16-msci-indonesia-emerging-market-downgrade-six-year-low","title":"MSCI Cuts Indonesia Status","date":"2026-10-15","url":"https://zuhd.news/a/2026-10-16-msci-indonesia-emerging-market-downgrade-six-year-low"},{"slug":"2026-10-19-indonesia-stocks-plunge-msci-downgrade-threat","title":"Jakarta Stocks Plunge on MSCI","date":"2026-10-19","url":"https://zuhd.news/a/2026-10-19-indonesia-stocks-plunge-msci-downgrade-threat"}]}},"mkt:bmv":{"eventId":"mkt:bmv:2026-10-09:1","kind":"monthly","changePct":7.066901733466624,"newsHash":"349da4cd328c9a4a","startDate":"2026-09-29","endDate":"2026-10-27","revision":7,"validated":{"text":"Mexican stocks on the Bolsa Mexicana de Valores rose 7.1% over 20 sessions to October 27. In the same weeks, inflation hit 3.62% in early October, above forecasts, and AT&T moved to sell 24.7 million Mexican subscribers for $2 billion. None of the coverage ties either event to the rise.","citations":[{"slug":"2026-10-22-mexico-inflation-banxico-rate-hold","title":"Mexico Inflation Accelerates","date":"2026-10-22","url":"https://zuhd.news/a/2026-10-22-mexico-inflation-banxico-rate-hold"},{"slug":"2026-10-14-att-sells-mexico-unit-televisa-2-billion","title":"AT&T Exits Mexico","date":"2026-10-14","url":"https://zuhd.news/a/2026-10-14-att-sells-mexico-unit-televisa-2-billion"}]}},"mkt:hkex":{"eventId":"mkt:hkex:2026-10-22:-1","kind":"weekly","changePct":-5.673605144654326,"newsHash":"4fec23cf69042412","startDate":"2026-10-14","endDate":"2026-10-22","revision":3,"validated":{"text":"Hong Kong stocks fell 5.7% across five sessions from 14 to 22 October. The week's China news included output cuts and price competition, with smelters trimming copper and MiniMax undercutting DeepSeek on AI pricing, but none of that coverage links these stories to the slide on the Hong Kong Stock Exchange.","citations":[{"slug":"2026-10-23-china-copper-smelters-output-cuts-treatment-fees-asarco","title":"China Smelters Trim Copper","date":"2026-10-22","url":"https://zuhd.news/a/2026-10-23-china-copper-smelters-output-cuts-treatment-fees-asarco"},{"slug":"2026-10-19-minimax-m3-1-flash-deepseek-price-war-china-ai","title":"MiniMax Undercuts DeepSeek Pricing","date":"2026-10-19","url":"https://zuhd.news/a/2026-10-19-minimax-m3-1-flash-deepseek-price-war-china-ai"}]}},"mkt:tadawul":{"eventId":"mkt:tadawul:2026-10-26:1","kind":"sharp","changePct":2.4979806159660223,"newsHash":"2c03692625e1feec","startDate":"2026-10-26","endDate":"2026-10-27","revision":8,"validated":{"text":"Saudi stocks on the Saudi Exchange in Riyadh rose 2.5% in a single session to 2026-10-27. The gain came as Saudi Arabia's defence minister met Iran's president in Tehran, a day after Saudi Arabia's air defences intercepted 10 ballistic missiles. No supplied report links the move to either event.","citations":[{"slug":"2026-10-27-tehran-meeting-iran-saudi-turkey-pakistan-talks","title":"Riyadh Talks to Tehran","date":"2026-10-27","url":"https://zuhd.news/a/2026-10-27-tehran-meeting-iran-saudi-turkey-pakistan-talks"},{"slug":"2026-10-26-houthi-missiles-saudi-east-west-pipeline-sanaa-launchers","title":"Houthis Claim Saudi Pipeline Strike","date":"2026-10-26","url":"https://zuhd.news/a/2026-10-26-houthi-missiles-saudi-east-west-pipeline-sanaa-launchers"}]}}}}
